            "text": "MEDIUM: marketing-exports (us-east-1) (aws_s3_bucket) not in IaC: marketing-exports is in no state file or stack checked. Exists in AWS but no state file or stack checked lists it; likely created in the console, the CLI or another tool."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
