          "ruleIndex": 2,
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "LOW: /aws/lambda/resize-images (us-east-1) (aws_cloudwatch_log_group) not in IaC: arn:aws:logs:us-east-1:111111111111:log-group:/aws/lambda/resize-images:* is in no state file or stack checked. Log group an AWS service created for one of your resources; manage it in IaC if you want retention and encryption under control."
          },
